WEBVTT

00:26:28.708 --> 00:26:32.893
you have the choice then
to either grant me trust or deny it.

00:26:32.917 --> 00:26:35.893
And that made me feel like I lack control

00:26:35.917 --> 00:26:38.851
over building the kind of relationships
that I want to build.

00:26:38.875 --> 00:26:41.726
And so I wondered if you could
help me get out of that trap.

00:26:41.750 --> 00:26:44.309
EP: This a perfect moment,
this is a perfect example,

00:26:44.333 --> 00:26:48.643
because you can't make me trust you,

00:26:48.667 --> 00:26:51.184
you think you have no power.

00:26:51.208 --> 00:26:55.851
When in fact you have all the power
to do the things that you can do,

00:26:55.875 --> 00:26:58.559
which hopefully will make me trust you.

00:26:58.583 --> 00:27:00.434
AG: But now I have probabilistic power